r-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Devlop marca presen\u00e7a na Feira de Inova\u00e7\u00e3o Agr\u00edcola do Fund\u00e3o: Participa\u00e7\u00e3o no painel \"Cadeias de Abastecimento e Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o\"<\/h5>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c5683d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c5683d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>No dia 10 de Outubro,\u00a0 a Devlop esteve presente na Feira de Inova\u00e7\u00e3o Agr\u00edcola do Fund\u00e3o, onde o nosso CEO, Hugo Duarte da Fonseca, participou no painel sobre Cadeias de Abastecimento e Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p>Durante esta interven\u00e7\u00e3o, partilhou as solu\u00e7\u00f5es inovadoras e sustent\u00e1veis que a Devlop tem desenvolvido no \u00e2mbito da <strong>NEXUS AGENDA: Pacto de Inova\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, um plano estrat\u00e9gico que visa a Transi\u00e7\u00e3o Verde e Digital nos setores dos Transportes, Log\u00edstica e Mobilidade.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-357bd40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"357bd40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));--align-self:var(--container-widget-align-self,initial);--flex-shrink:0}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container{height:100%;width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty{position:relative;min-height:22px;min-width:22px}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;margin:auto;padding:0;width:22px;height:22px}<\/style>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99fb022 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99fb022\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b39dda4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b39dda4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A <strong>Agenda NEXUS<\/strong>, liderada pelo Porto de Sines, \u00e9 um projeto pioneiro que visa promover um futuro digital e sustent\u00e1vel, com o objetivo de descarbonizar os portos e as cadeias de valor associadas. Esta agenda ambiciosa concentra-se na transi\u00e7\u00e3o digital e ecol\u00f3gica dos setores de transporte e log\u00edstica, atrav\u00e9s do desenvolvimento de <strong>31 novos produtos e servi\u00e7os<\/strong>, todos de elevada inova\u00e7\u00e3o. Entre as principais \u00e1reas de atua\u00e7\u00e3o, destacam-se:<\/p><ul><li>Intelig\u00eancia Artificial (IA)<\/li><li>Tecnologia 5G<\/li><li>Ciberseguran\u00e7a<\/li><li>Open Data<\/li><li>Algoritmos predicativos para a gest\u00e3o de recursos energ\u00e9ticos<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e7a6a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1e7a6a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c106fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0c106fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f901d0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f901d0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Todas estas solu\u00e7\u00f5es tecnol\u00f3gicas s\u00e3o aplicadas diretamente \u00e0s opera\u00e7\u00f5es portu\u00e1rias e log\u00edsticas, modernizando e tornando mais eficiente o ecossistema em torno dos portos.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8745623 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"8745623\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df3fb59 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"df3fb59\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>O papel da Devlop na Agenda NEXUS<\/h5><p>A Devlop tem um papel central neste projeto, sendo respons\u00e1vel pelo desenvolvimento de diversos produtos no \u00e2mbito do <strong>Nexus Smart Logistics (WP5)<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Este pacote de trabalho, composto por <strong>cinco projetos independentes mas interligados<\/strong>, foca-se na digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e integra\u00e7\u00e3o das atividades de transporte e servi\u00e7os log\u00edsticos que envolvem o hinterland e foreland do porto.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7be3dd6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"7be3dd6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa1916a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aa1916a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>O <strong>Nexus Smart Logistics (WP5)<\/strong> visa transformar o setor ao incorporar tecnologias emergentes no mercado, atrav\u00e9s da cria\u00e7\u00e3o de novos produtos especificamente desenhados para otimizar o ecossistema portu\u00e1rio global. Entre os projetos que integram este pacote, destacam-se:<\/p><ul><li><strong>WEBTRANS<\/strong>: Plataforma de gest\u00e3o de transporte digital.<\/li><li><strong>3D Smart Depot Panel<\/strong>: Sistema inteligente de monitoriza\u00e7\u00e3o de dep\u00f3sitos.<\/li><li><strong>eBL<\/strong>: Documento de transporte digital (Electronic Bill of Lading).<\/li><li><strong>eCMR<\/strong>: Carta de porte digital.<\/li><li><strong>SHoT \u2013 Shipping on Time<\/strong>: Solu\u00e7\u00e3o para a otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o de opera\u00e7\u00f5es de envio.<\/li><li><strong>Shipperform<\/strong>: Plataforma para digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o de processos de envio.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Cada um destes projetos contribui para a moderniza\u00e7\u00e3o e digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do setor log\u00edstico, com o intuito de melhorar a efici\u00eancia operacional e reduzir o impacto ambiental das opera\u00e7\u00f5es portu\u00e1rias.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca7359e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"ca7359e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1777bc7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1777bc7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>A import\u00e2ncia da participa\u00e7\u00e3o da Devlop<\/h5><p>A nossa participa\u00e7\u00e3o na Feira de Inova\u00e7\u00e3o Agr\u00edcola do Fund\u00e3o e no painel &#8220;Cadeias de Abastecimento e Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o&#8221; foi essencial para divulgar a <strong>Agenda NEXUS<\/strong>, que combina inova\u00e7\u00e3o tecnol\u00f3gica com pr\u00e1ticas mais sustent\u00e1veis.<\/p><p>O objetivo final \u00e9 tornar os portos portugueses mais competitivos e menos dependentes das exporta\u00e7\u00f5es, ao mesmo tempo que se promove a sustentabilidade das cadeias log\u00edsticas e de transporte.<\/p><p>A <strong>Agenda NEXUS<\/strong> est\u00e1 a revolucionar os setores dos Transportes e Log\u00edstica ao conjugar a inova\u00e7\u00e3o no desenvolvimento de ferramentas digitais com novos equipamentos inteligentes e descarbonizados.<\/p><p>Este esfor\u00e7o \u00e9 um passo decisivo para aumentar a competitividade dos portos nacionais e melhorar a efici\u00eancia das opera\u00e7\u00f5es, assegurando ao mesmo tempo a sustentabilidade futura das cadeias log\u00edsticas.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Se quiser saber mais sobre os produtos desenvolvidos pela Devlop no \u00e2mbito desta agenda, conhe\u00e7a a nossa p\u00e1gina <a href=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/agenda-nexus\/\">Projetos NEXUS<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85e5b74 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"85e5b74\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00af709 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"00af709\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c90581 elementor-skin-carousel elementor-arrows-yes elementor-pagination-type-bullets elementor-pagination-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-media-carousel\" data-id=\"3c90581\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:8,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;skin&quot;:&quot;carousel&quot;,&quot;effect&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pagination&quot;:&quot;bullets&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&qu